me. One more thing to factor in though—the few-shot gains are modest, around 1.76 percentage points for Qwen-7B, so I'd expect similar or slightly larger improvements for GPT-4o and Claude.\n\nLooking at the frontier model numbers, the gap between SFT exception_only performance and the best few-shot results is only about 2.5 percentage points, which seems reasonable given how much stronger these models are at instruction-following and structured formats. I'm adjusting the estimates slightly upward to reflect that they might push closer to 97-98% under the worst tier conditions.\n\nNow I'm moving into writing the YAML configuration itself, keeping it as compact as possible while capturing all the necessary experiment details. I need to structure the expected_results field properly as a dictionary mapping metrics to their values, and I'm reviewing the complete budget curve data for Qwen-7B to ensure the pattern is clean and monotonic across all the different head and tail configurations.\n\nWriting YAML output...\n\nNow I'm cross-checking the tail-384 numbers against the full budget curve data for each model, particularly looking at the Qwen-7B entries where I'm noticing some naming inconsistencies in the registry—there are versions with and without underscores that show different accuracy values, so I need to identify which one is the canonical experiment. the tail experiments show consistent patterns across models—tail-256 hovers around 77-79% while tail-512 jumps to 93-97%—so I'll use those ranges for the predictions rather than getting bogged down in exact values. Now I'm writing out the final YAML structure with the narrative guidance and experiment details, using multiline strings for the longer text fields.\n\nFor the narrative, I'm reframing the core contribution away from the budget curve analysis since it doesn't show meaningful structural insights—the tail-384 results are just gradual improvements across all four models with no sharp phase transitions, and the cross-seed variance on tail-512 undermines robustness claims. Instead, I'm elevating the exception isolation findings and the component ablation methodology as the main contributions, while highlighting how consistently the models hit that 99.3-100% exception ceiling. The few-shot baselines from GPT-4o and Claude narrow the SFT advantage to around 2.5 percentage points, though the inference cost argument still holds. The out-of-distribution generalization is weak at roughly 82%, which limits broader applicability.\n\nLooking at the realistic positioning, this feels like a Findings paper for EMNLP with maybe 10-30% acceptance odds—the exception isolation and ablation methodology are solid, but the phase transition story doesn't materialize and the language limitations are apparent. I should plan some targeted experiments to strengthen this, particularly a fine-grained phase transition study across the four models on the tail-384 setup.\n\nNow I'm verifying the exception-only accuracy metrics across the models. The non-outlier range sits at 99.33-100%, which aligns with the observed data I'm documenting—this is just confirming what we've already measured rather than making new predictions.\n\nTime to write out the YAML structure with focused predictions and clear reasoning.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41500,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41500},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f2cdb2a6-77cd-4a2d-b927-902f5b005216","uuid":"9240ec37-dc8b-4252-894e-82ebe1917734"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01LaVXZW4qsCV2yDMVzxPokC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >-\n  P1 实验未产生 budget curve structural insight。tail-384 在 4 模型上均为 gradual（mean 89.4%），\n  无 sharp phase transition，仅 trivial monotonic 'more tokens → better'。Cross-seed tail-512\n  在 DeepSeek 上 std=6.4pp，phase transition 幅度不 seed-robust，最差 seed 仅比 tail-256 高 5.7pp。\n  Budget curve 降级为 appendix monotonic trend，不作为独立 contribution。Reframe 策略：(1) 砍 budget\n  curve contribution，仅 appendix 报告；(2) 论文收缩为 diagnostic signal ablation study；(3) LoRA\n  seed sensitivity + train_loss≈accuracy decoupling 提升为 methodological contribution；(4) 强调\n  4 模型 exception ceiling 一致性 (99.3-100% non-outlier) 作为核心 thesis。Few-shot GPT-4o/Claude\n  baseline 缩小 SFT 优势至 ~2.5pp，削弱 SFT necessity 叙事但 inference cost 论点仍可用。OOD 泛化差\n  (~82%)，单语言局限暴露。Error analysis 无新发现。Training dynamics 仅确认 trivial 预期。Overall:\n  2-3 distinct contributions，EMNLP main accept 概率 10-30%，Findings 为 realistic landing。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"tail-384 fine-grained phase transition (4 models)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: \"tail-384 × 4 模型，精确定位 256→512 之间是 sharp transition 还是 gradual ramp\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b_tail384_accuracy: 0.891\n      qwen7b_tail384_ci: [0.868, 0.912]\n      deepseek7b_tail384_accuracy: 0.882\n      deepseek7b_tail384_ci: [0.859, 0.904]\n      qwen15b_tail384_accuracy: 0.885\n      qwen15b_tail384_ci: [0.862, 0.907]\n      codellama13b_tail384_accuracy: 0.918\n      codellama13b_tail384_ci: [0.898, 0.936]\n      four_model_mean: 0.894\n      four_model_std: 0.016\n      max_diff_vs_tail256_pp: 15.9\n      min_diff_vs_tail256_pp: 9.2\n      fraction_of_256to512_gain_at_384_mean: 0.71\n    result_rationale: >-\n      在 worst 档下，tail-384 落在 88-93% 区间（mean 89.4%），位于 tail-256（~76-79%）和 tail-512\n      （~94-97%）之间偏上位置。这意味着 256→384 已获取约 71% 的 256→512 总增益，384→512 仅贡献剩余\n      29%。曲线呈平滑凹形（concave, diminishing returns），无任何 token 数阈值处的阶跃函数特征。根因：\n      tail 截断保留 trace 末尾的 exception/assertion 信息，384 tokens 已捕获大部分 exception 事件\n      （平均 exception 长度 ~50-150 tokens），额外 128 tokens（384→512）仅增量覆盖更长的 stack trace\n      和额外 assertion output。CodeLlama-13B 因模型容量更大（13B vs 6-7B），在同等 token budget 下\n      利用信息效率更高，故 tail-384 达 91.8%。DeepSeek 因已知的 LoRA 训练不稳定性，在 intermediate\n      token budget 下 accuracy 略低于其他模型。关键结论：256→512 的 accuracy 跳跃是 information\n      accumulation 的连续过程，而非 phase transition。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 4-Model Tail Budget Curve (Complete)\"\n        content: |\n          | Tail tokens | Qwen-7B | DeepSeek-7B | Qwen-1.5B | CodeLlama-13B | Mean |\n          |-------------|---------|-------------|-----------|---------------|------|\n          | 256         | 77.5%   | 76.4%       | 72.6%     | 77.9%         | 76.1%|\n          | 384 (NEW)   | 89.1%   | 88.2%       | 88.5%     | 91.8%         | 89.4%|\n          | 512         | 93.6%   | 93.9%       | 95.6%     | 97.5%         | 95.2%|\n          | 1024        | 96.5%   | 96.5%       | 96.6%     | 98.2%         | 97.0%|\n          | 2048        | 97.3%   | 95.0%       | 97.9%     | collapse       | —   |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4-model tail budget curve line plot: x=tail tokens (log scale), y=accuracy。所有模型显示平滑单调递增，无明显拐点。256→384 和 384→512 的斜率连续递减，无阶跃特征。CodeLlama-2048 点缺失（collapse）。\"\n    analysis: >-\n      结果排除 sharp phase transition 假说。budget curve 仅描述 trivial monotonic pattern（more\n      tokens → better），不构成 structured finding。审稿人会问 'so what?'——无法从中提取有意义的\n      design guideline（除 'use more tokens'）。建议：将 budget curve 降级为 appendix Figure，\n      正文一句话概括 'accuracy increases monotonically with tail token budget (Appendix X)'。\n      不作为独立 contribution。唯一可保留的 insight：tail >> head 的方向性（已在现有数据中确立），\n      但这也不需要 384 点来证明。plan_016 的边际贡献为零。\n\n  - name: \"cross-seed budget curve tail-512 (4 models × 3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_017\"\n    description: \"tail-512 × 4 模型 × 3 seeds，验证 phase transition 后 convergence band robustness\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b_seeds: [0.936, 0.918, 0.943]\n      qwen7b_mean: 0.932\n      qwen7b_std_pp: 1.3\n      deepseek7b_seeds: [0.939, 0.821, 0.924]\n      deepseek7b_mean: 0.895\n      deepseek7b_std_pp: 6.4\n      qwen15b_seeds: [0.956, 0.925, 0.941]\n      qwen15b_mean: 0.941\n      qwen15b_std_pp: 1.6\n      codellama13b_seeds: [0.975, 0.928, 0.961]\n      codellama13b_mean: 0.955\n      codellama13b_std_pp: 2.5\n      max_std_across_models_pp: 6.4\n      min_256to512_gain_worst_seed_pp: 5.7\n      deepseek_worst_seed_accuracy: 0.821\n    result_rationale: >-\n      DeepSeek 的 LoRA 初始化敏感性（exception_only seed123=91.09% vs seed42=99.33%）在 tail-512\n      条件下更为严重。tail-512 的学习任务比 exception_only 更难——需要从 512 tokens 的混合 trace\n      content（包含 exception + partial loop + variable values）中提取 verdict signal，对 LoRA\n      初始化 basin 的要求更高。DeepSeek seed123 的 fail_recall 预计仅 ~55-60%（类比 exception_only\n      seed123 的 0.705），导致整体 accuracy 降至 ~82%。此时 tail-512 worst seed（82.1%）与 tail-256\n      (76.4%) 的差距仅 5.7pp，可被审稿人解读为 noise 而非 phase transition。其他 3 模型 std 在\n      1.3-2.5pp 范围内，较为稳定但不足以弥补 DeepSeek 的高方差。关键问题：如果 phase transition\n      的幅度在最差 seed 上仅 5.7pp 且 CI overlap with noise，则 'sharp transition at ~400 tokens'\n      的叙事完全不成立。即使在稳定模型上（Qwen-7B seed range 91.8-94.3%），cross-seed CI 也与\n      tail-384 预测区间重叠，进一步模糊 transition 边界。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Seed Tail-512 Results\"\n        content: |\n          | Model         | Seed 42 | Seed 123 | Seed 456 | Mean   | Std (pp) |\n          |---------------|---------|----------|----------|--------|----------|\n          | Qwen-7B       | 93.6%   | 91.8%    | 94.3%    | 93.2%  | 1.3      |\n          | DeepSeek-7B   | 93.9%   | 82.1%    | 92.4%    | 89.5%  | 6.4      |\n          | Qwen-1.5B     | 95.6%   | 92.5%    | 94.1%    | 94.1%  | 1.6      |\n          | CodeLlama-13B | 97.5%   | 92.8%    | 96.1%    | 95.5%  | 2.5      |\n      - name: \"Table: Worst-Seed 256→512 Gain\"\n        content: |\n          | Model         | Tail-256 | Worst-seed Tail-512 | Gain (pp) |\n          |---------------|----------|---------------------|-----------|\n          | Qwen-7B       | 77.5%    | 91.8%               | 14.3      |\n          | DeepSeek-7B   | 76.4%    | 82.1%               | 5.7       |\n          | Qwen-1.5B     | 72.6%    | 92.5%               | 19.9      |\n          | CodeLlama-13B | 77.9%    | 92.8%               | 14.9      |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Box plot: 4 模型 × tail-512 accuracy，每个 box 3 seeds。DeepSeek 的 whisker 远大于其他模型，seed123 为明显离群点。\"\n    analysis: >-\n      DeepSeek std=6.4pp 直接破坏 phase transition claim 的 universality。即使 3/4 模型稳定，\n      审稿人只需指向 DeepSeek worst seed（82.1%）说 'phase transition 幅度不 robust，最差 seed\n      仅 5.7pp gain，与 noise 无法区分'。这使得 budget curve 作为 structural finding 的叙事彻底\n      瓦解。plan_017 的结果反而提供 negative evidence，强化了 'budget curve is trivial monotonic'\n      的 worst-tier 判断。唯一正面用途：DeepSeek seed sensitivity 数据可用来强化 D9（LoRA\n      initialization sensitivity）的 generality——不仅 exception_only，tail-512 也显示同样的\n      pattern。这支持将 seed sensitivity 提升为独立 methodological finding。\n\n  - name: \"error analysis (existing predictions)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_018\"\n    description: \"用已有 predictions.jsonl 分析 failure modes——哪类程序/错误容易被误判\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only_total_errors: 2\n      exception_only_error_ids: [901, 905]\n      exception_only_error_root_cause: \"GeneratorExit (already known)\"\n      vota_total_errors: 7\n      vota_error_types: { pass_to_fail: 3, fail_to_pass: 4 }\n      vota_problem_concentration: \"scattered, no dominant problem type\"\n      full_trace_total_errors: 217\n      full_trace_fail_recall: 0.696\n      full_trace_dominant_error_pattern: \"complex control flow with nested exceptions, but not statistically concentrated\"\n      no_trace_total_errors: 296\n      no_trace_bias: \"majority-class (pass) prediction bias\"\n      cross_condition_error_overlap: \"higher-condition errors are strict subset of lower-condition errors\"\n      novel_failure_taxonomy: false\n    result_rationale: >-\n      Exception_only 仅 2 个 irreducible errors（GeneratorExit），已在 D5 中完整分析，无新信息可提取。\n      VOTA 的 7 个错误分散在 7 个不同 problem 中（4 个 fail→pass 和 3 个 pass→fail），无统计上显著的\n      problem type 聚集——这是 99.41% accuracy 下 N=7 的必然结果：样本量太小无法建立有意义的 failure\n      taxonomy。Full_trace 的 217 个错误中，约 40% 来自 fail 样本（fail_recall=0.696），轻微集中在\n      含嵌套异常或复杂 generator/decorator 的题目上，但 chi-squared test 对 problem type 分布无显著\n      结果（p>0.1）。No_trace 的 296 个错误以 majority-class bias 为主（模型倾向预测 pass），这在\n      class-imbalanced 设置（71.5% pass）下是预期行为。Cross-condition error overlap 分析显示\n      exception_only 的 2 个错误 ⊂ VOTA 的 7 个 ⊂ full_trace 的 217 个，符合 hierarchy 预期但\n      不是新发现。整体上，error analysis 确认已知结论但不产生 novel insight。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Error Summary by Condition\"\n        content: |\n          | Condition      | Errors | Error rate | Dominant pattern              |\n          |----------------|--------|------------|-------------------------------|\n          | exception_only | 2      | 0.17%      | GeneratorExit (known)         |\n          | VOTA           | 7      | 0.59%      | scattered, no pattern         |\n          | full_trace     | 217    | 18.2%      | weak: complex control flow    |\n          | no_trace       | 296    | 24.9%      | majority-class bias           |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Confusion matrix heatmap × 4 conditions。exception_only 和 VOTA 几乎全白（极少错误），full_trace 和 no_trace 显示 fail class 的 recall 问题。无 striking pattern。\"\n    analysis: >-\n      Error analysis 不产生可作为 contribution 的 finding。exception_only 的 2 个 errors 已有\n      完整根因分析（D5），N=7 的 VOTA 错误无法支撑统计分析。建议：将 error analysis 作为 appendix\n      的完整性补充（reviewers expect it），但不要 claim 它为 contribution。正文一段话概括\n      'errors decrease monotonically with signal specificity; remaining errors at Tier 1\n      are representation-inherent (GeneratorExit)' 即可。\n\n  - name: \"cross-model calibration (4 models × exception_only)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_019\"\n    description: \"4 模型 × exception_only ECE/Brier 对比，验证 calibration quality 是否 universal\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b_ece: 0.0027\n      qwen7b_brier: 0.0013\n      qwen15b_ece: 0.0085\n      qwen15b_brier: 0.0038\n      codellama13b_ece: 0.0032\n      codellama13b_brier: 0.0015\n      deepseek7b_seed42_ece: 0.0048\n      deepseek7b_seed42_brier: 0.0052\n      deepseek7b_seed456_ece: 0.0051\n      deepseek7b_seed456_brier: 0.0055\n      deepseek7b_seed123_ece: 0.0652\n      deepseek7b_seed123_brier: 0.0781\n      deepseek7b_mean_ece: 0.025\n      cross_model_nonoutlier_ece_max: 0.0085\n      calibration_universality: \"3/4 models excellent; DeepSeek seed-dependent\"\n    result_rationale: >-\n      Calibration quality 本质上跟踪 accuracy：高 accuracy 模型（99.33-99.83%）的预测概率分布\n      集中在极端值（>0.99 或 <0.01），ECE 自然极低。Qwen-7B（ECE=0.0027, 已知）和 CodeLlama-13B\n      （预计 ECE=0.0032）均在 99.83% accuracy，其 calibration 几乎等价。Qwen-1.5B 虽然 accuracy\n      也是 99.83%，但 1.5B 模型的 logit distribution 通常更 peaked/uncertain，softmax 温度不同\n      导致 ECE 略高（~0.0085）但仍在优秀范围内。DeepSeek 的 seed 依赖性直接传导到 calibration：\n      seed42/456（99.33%）的 ECE ~0.005，尚可；但 seed123（91.09%）的 fail_recall 仅 0.705，意味着\n      大量 fail 样本被以 >0.5 的概率预测为 pass，导致 ECE 飙升至 ~0.065。跨模型 calibration 的叙事\n      在 worst 档下变为 'model-dependent'——3/4 模型优秀，但 DeepSeek 的 seed sensitivity 使得\n      '4 模型 universally excellent calibration' 的 claim 不成立。非离群 seeds 的 ECE 上界 0.0085\n      仍然很好，但审稿人会聚焦 DeepSeek seed123。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model Exception_Only Calibration\"\n        content: |\n          | Model          | Seed | Accuracy | ECE    | Brier  |\n          |----------------|------|----------|--------|--------|\n          | Qwen-7B        | 42   | 99.83%   | 0.0027 | 0.0013 |\n          | Qwen-1.5B      | 42   | 99.83%   | 0.0085 | 0.0038 |\n          | CodeLlama-13B  | 42   | 99.83%   | 0.0032 | 0.0015 |\n          | DeepSeek-7B    | 42   | 99.33%   | 0.0048 | 0.0052 |\n          | DeepSeek-7B    | 456  | 99.33%   | 0.0051 | 0.0055 |\n          | DeepSeek-7B    | 123  | 91.09%   | 0.0652 | 0.0781 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Reliability diagram × 4 models：Qwen-7B/1.5B 和 CodeLlama-13B 的曲线几乎与 perfect calibration diagonal 重合。DeepSeek seed42/456 轻微偏离。DeepSeek seed123 在 0.4-0.8 概率 bin 严重偏离（over-confident on incorrect pass predictions）。\"\n    analysis: >-\n      Cross-model calibration 作为独立 finding 的价值有限——calibration 跟踪 accuracy 是已知规律，\n      不提供独立 evidence dimension。在 worst 档下，DeepSeek seed123 的差 calibration（ECE=0.065）\n      使 'universal calibration excellence' 不可 claim。建议：在正文 Results 中用一段话报告\n      non-outlier 模型的 calibration 一致性（ECE<0.01），将 DeepSeek seed123 的 calibration\n      退化归因于 LoRA initialization（与 D9 一致），完整 reliability diagrams 放 appendix。\n      不作为独立 contribution。\n\n  - name: \"few-shot prompting baseline (GPT-4o / Claude)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_020\"\n    description: \"GPT-4o/Claude 在 exception_only 格式输入上的 0-shot + 3-shot verdict prediction\"\n    expected_results:\n      gpt4o_zeroshot_accuracy: 0.945\n      gpt4o_zeroshot_ci: [0.932, 0.957]\n      gpt4o_fewshot_accuracy: 0.965\n      gpt4o_fewshot_ci: [0.955, 0.975]\n      claude_zeroshot_accuracy: 0.953\n      claude_zeroshot_ci: [0.941, 0.964]\n      claude_fewshot_accuracy: 0.971\n      claude_fewshot_ci: [0.961, 0.980]\n      sft_exception_only_qwen7b: 0.9983\n      sft_vs_best_fewshot_gap_pp: 2.7\n      local_model_zeroshot_qwen7b: 0.8908\n      local_model_fewshot_qwen7b: 0.9084\n    result_rationale: >-\n      Exception_only 格式的输入结构极为简单——本质上是 '[ERROR] type: message' 的列表或空标记。\n      Frontier models（GPT-4o, Claude）在 binary classification from structured input 上极为\n      擅长，且具备 Python 异常类型的丰富知识。Zero-shot 下，frontier model 能直接推理 '[ERROR]\n      存在→fail; 不存在→pass'，达到 94-95%；少量 errors 来自 GeneratorExit 等边缘 case 和模型\n      对 'no exception but still fail'（assertion error 不在 exception_only 中）的处理。Few-shot\n      examples 明确 format 约定和边界 case 后，accuracy 进一步提升至 96-97%。相比之下，SFT\n      exception_only（99.83%）仍以 ~2.7pp 领先最佳 few-shot，但此差距在统计上虽 significant（McNemar\n      p<0.05），实际意义有限。Worst 档下的关键问题：审稿人会指出 'GPT-4o few-shot 已达 96.5%，7B\n      model SFT 仅多 3pp，是否值得 SFT overhead？'——虽然 inference cost 论点成立（7B vs GPT-4o\n      每 token 成本差 ~100x），但 'SFT uniquely enables this capability' 的叙事被削弱。\n      与已有本地模型 zero-shot 数据的对比更有意义：Qwen-7B zero-shot 89.08% vs GPT-4o zero-shot\n      94.5% → frontier model 以 5.4pp 领先同等 zero-shot，但 SFT 后 Qwen-7B 99.83% 反超 5.3pp。\n      这说明 SFT 的价值在于弥合 model capability gap。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: SFT vs Prompting Comparison\"\n        content: |\n          | Method                          | Accuracy | Cost/sample | Latency |\n          |---------------------------------|----------|-------------|---------|\n          | Qwen-7B SFT exception_only      | 99.83%   | ~$0.0001    | <100ms  |\n          | Claude 3-shot exception_only     | 97.1%    | ~$0.01      | ~2s     |\n          | GPT-4o 3-shot exception_only     | 96.5%    | ~$0.008     | ~1.5s   |\n          | Claude 0-shot exception_only     | 95.3%    | ~$0.005     | ~1s     |\n          | GPT-4o 0-shot exception_only     | 94.5%    | ~$0.004     | ~1s     |\n          | Qwen-1.5B 0-shot exception_only  | 93.5%    | ~$0.00005   | <50ms   |\n          | Qwen-7B 3-shot exception_only    | 90.8%    | ~$0.0001    | <100ms  |\n          | Qwen-7B 0-shot exception_only    | 89.1%    | ~$0.0001    | <100ms  |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: accuracy by method，按 accuracy 降序排列。SFT 最高但 GPT-4o/Claude few-shot 紧随其后，视觉上 gap 不大。\"\n    analysis: >-\n      SFT 优势收缩至 ~2.7pp under worst 档。审稿人反应分两派：(1) 'SFT 仍 statistically\n      significantly better, 且 inference cost 低 100x, 值得'；(2) 'gap 太小, frontier model\n      随版本更新可能抹平, SFT 的 practical value 不明确'。论文应 preemptively address：SFT 的\n      价值不仅在于 accuracy（+2.7pp），更在于 (a) 将 7B model 提升到 frontier-model-level\n      performance（cost reduction），(b) 在 deployment 场景下的 latency/throughput 优势，\n      (c) 隐私——exception traces 不需要发送到外部 API。但 'SFT 是 verdict task 的唯一可行路径'\n      的强 claim 不再成立。建议降级为 'SFT 是 cost-effective 路径'。\n\n  - name: \"OOD generalization (cross-language traces)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_021\"\n    description: \"在 Java/JavaScript/C++ 的 trace 上测试 exception_only 泛化性\"\n    expected_results:\n      java_accuracy: 0.845\n      java_ci: [0.81, 0.88]\n      javascript_accuracy: 0.813\n      javascript_ci: [0.77, 0.85]\n      cpp_accuracy: 0.762\n      cpp_ci: [0.72, 0.80]\n      cross_language_mean: 0.807\n      indomain_accuracy: 0.9983\n      ood_degradation_pp: 19.1\n      ood_dataset_size: \"~200 samples per language (estimated)\"\n    result_rationale: >-\n      Exception_only 模型在训练时仅见 Python 的异常格式（ValueError, TypeError, IndexError,\n      AttributeError 等），这些是 Python-specific exception 类名。OOD 语言使用不同的异常类型\n      （Java: NullPointerException, ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException; JS: TypeError, ReferenceError\n      但 message 格式不同; C++: segfault, runtime_error 文本差异更大）。虽然 exception_only 的\n      '[ERROR] type: ... message: ...' 格式是 language-agnostic 的，但模型学到的是 Python\n      exception type name → verdict 的映射，而非通用的 'error presence → fail' 规则。如果模型\n      真的只学了 '[ERROR] tag 有无' 的 binary feature，OOD 应该不降——但 format marker removal\n      实验（plan_015）显示移除标记后 accuracy 降至 96.5%，说明模型确实利用了 exception content\n      而非仅 tag presence。OOD 语言的 exception content 分布偏移导致 accuracy 显著下降。Java\n      因 exception 语义与 Python 最接近（同为 OOP，exception hierarchy 类似）而表现最好（84.5%）；\n      C++ 的 error output 格式差异最大（无标准 exception hierarchy，segfault 等信号格式不同），\n      降至 76.2%。Cross-language mean ~80.7%，比 in-domain 低 19pp。这一结果会被审稿人用来攻击\n      generalization claim，要求 multi-language training。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: OOD Cross-Language Results\"\n        content: |\n          | Language   | Accuracy | Δ vs in-domain | Notes                        |\n          |------------|----------|----------------|------------------------------|\n          | Python (ID)| 99.83%   | —              | in-domain reference          |\n          | Java       | 84.5%    | -15.3pp        | similar OOP exception model  |\n          | JavaScript | 81.3%    | -18.5pp        | different error conventions  |\n          | C++        | 76.2%    | -23.6pp        | no standard exception format |\n          | Mean OOD   | 80.7%    | -19.1pp        |                              |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: in-domain Python vs 3 OOD languages。Python 近乎满分，OOD 语言显著低于 Python，按 Java > JS > C++ 递降。error bars 宽（~200 samples/language）。\"\n    analysis: >-\n      19pp OOD 降级是 worst 档下的 critical weakness。审稿人会说 'exception signal 的 effectiveness\n      高度 language-specific，99.83% 是 Python-specific 的 artifact，不能 generalize'。论文的\n      mitigation 有限：(1) 定位为 Python-focused empirical study（但削弱 general claim）；(2) 论证\n      exception format 的 language-agnostic 设计原则（需要 multi-language training 来验证，超出\n      scope）；(3) 将 OOD 结果放 limitation section。建议：如果 OOD 数据质量可控，可以尝试\n      multi-language mixed training 看 accuracy 是否恢复，但这需要额外 12+ GPU hours 且可能\n      打开 scope creep。Under worst 档，plan_021 的结果是 net negative——暴露局限性但不提供\n      解决方案。建议推迟到 camera-ready 或 follow-up work。\n\n  - name: \"training dynamics (learning curve comparison)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_022\"\n    description: \"exception_only vs full_trace 的 per-50-steps eval learning curve，分析收敛速度差异\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only_steps_to_95pct: 80\n      exception_only_steps_to_99pct: 150\n      exception_only_total_steps: ~450\n      full_trace_steps_to_80pct: 120\n      full_trace_peak_accuracy: 0.830\n      full_trace_peak_step: 180\n      full_trace_final_accuracy: 0.818\n      convergence_speed_ratio_to_95pct: \"exception_only ~1.5x faster (trivial)\"\n      learning_curve_shape_exception: \"rapid ascent to plateau by 1/3 epoch, then flat\"\n      learning_curve_shape_full_trace: \"slow noisy ascent, mild overshoot at epoch1, regression at epoch2, partial recovery epoch3\"\n      phase_transition_in_learning: false\n    result_rationale: >-\n      Exception_only 的训练样本极短（平均 ~30-50 tokens relevant content），模型在 ~80 steps\n      （约 1/6 epoch）即可学到 '[ERROR] → fail, no error → pass' 的核心映射，by step 150\n      达到 99%+ accuracy。这不是 surprising finding——shorter input + cleaner signal = faster\n      convergence 是 trivial prediction。Full_trace 的 learning curve 更复杂但也不产生 insight：\n      初期缓慢上升（model 在大量 trace tokens 中搜索 relevant signal），epoch 1 峰值 ~83%（模型\n      初步学到一些 heuristics），epoch 2 回退至 ~76%（overfitting to training noise），epoch 3\n      部分恢复至 ~82%。这种 non-monotonic pattern 与现有数据（full_trace_seed42_v5 epoch level:\n      epoch1=83.03%, epoch2=76.30%, final=81.76%）完全一致，per-50-steps 数据只是在已知 epoch-level\n      数据之间做了插值，不提供新 finding。关键缺失：learning curve 中没有 'phase transition in\n      learning'——exception_only 不是先学 noise 再突然 snap to correct mapping，而是平滑快速收敛。\n      这排除了 'sudden generalization / grokking' 类叙事的可能。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Convergence Milestones\"\n        content: |\n          | Condition      | Steps to 80% | Steps to 90% | Steps to 95% | Peak | Final |\n          |----------------|-------------|-------------|-------------|------|-------|\n          | exception_only | 30          | 60          | 80          | 99.83%| 99.83%|\n          | full_trace     | 120         | —           | —           | 83.0% | 81.8% |\n          | VOTA           | 50          | 80          | 100         | 99.41%| 99.41%|\n          | no_trace       | 150         | —           | —           | 76.3% | 75.1% |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curve plot: x=training steps, y=eval accuracy。exception_only 快速跃升至 plateau（step ~80 后水平线）。full_trace 缓慢波动上升，可见 epoch boundary 处的 non-monotonic 跳跃。两条曲线 shape 差异明显但 interpretation trivial。\"\n    analysis: >-\n      Training dynamics 仅确认 trivial 预期：simpler input → faster convergence。无 grokking、\n      无 phase transition in learning、无 surprising convergence phenomenon。Per-50-steps\n      granularity 对已有 epoch-level 数据做了插值但不改变结论。审稿人不会对此印象深刻。建议：\n      将 learning curve 作为 appendix supplementary figure（completeness），正文一句话 'exception_only\n      converges within 1/6 epoch, while full_trace shows non-monotonic epoch-level dynamics\n      consistent with information overload'。不作为 contribution。plan_022 的边际贡献接近零，\n      且需要修改训练脚本增加 intermediate eval，8 GPU hours 的 ROI 极低。在 worst 档下建议\n      砍掉或推迟。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41500,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41500},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f2cdb2a6-77cd-4a2d-b927-902f5b005216","uuid":"4eabf986-75ec-4e07-852b-672e0313c254"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":516386,"duration_api_ms":518237,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >-\n  P1 实验未产生 budget curve structural insight。tail-384 在 4 模型上均为 gradual（mean 89.4%），\n  无 sharp phase transition，仅 trivial monotonic 'more tokens → better'。Cross-seed tail-512\n  在 DeepSeek 上 std=6.4pp，phase transition 幅度不 seed-robust，最差 seed 仅比 tail-256 高 5.7pp。\n  Budget curve 降级为 appendix monotonic trend，不作为独立 contribution。Reframe 策略：(1) 砍 budget\n  curve contribution，仅 appendix 报告；(2) 论文收缩为 diagnostic signal ablation study；(3) LoRA\n  seed sensitivity + train_loss≈accuracy decoupling 提升为 methodological contribution；(4) 强调\n  4 模型 exception ceiling 一致性 (99.3-100% non-outlier) 作为核心 thesis。Few-shot GPT-4o/Claude\n  baseline 缩小 SFT 优势至 ~2.5pp，削弱 SFT necessity 叙事但 inference cost 论点仍可用。OOD 泛化差\n  (~82%)，单语言局限暴露。Error analysis 无新发现。Training dynamics 仅确认 trivial 预期。Overall:\n  2-3 distinct contributions，EMNLP main accept 概率 10-30%，Findings 为 realistic landing。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"tail-384 fine-grained phase transition (4 models)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: \"tail-384 × 4 模型，精确定位 256→512 之间是 sharp transition 还是 gradual ramp\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b_tail384_accuracy: 0.891\n      qwen7b_tail384_ci: [0.868, 0.912]\n      deepseek7b_tail384_accuracy: 0.882\n      deepseek7b_tail384_ci: [0.859, 0.904]\n      qwen15b_tail384_accuracy: 0.885\n      qwen15b_tail384_ci: [0.862, 0.907]\n      codellama13b_tail384_accuracy: 0.918\n      codellama13b_tail384_ci: [0.898, 0.936]\n      four_model_mean: 0.894\n      four_model_std: 0.016\n      max_diff_vs_tail256_pp: 15.9\n      min_diff_vs_tail256_pp: 9.2\n      fraction_of_256to512_gain_at_384_mean: 0.71\n    result_rationale: >-\n      在 worst 档下，tail-384 落在 88-93% 区间（mean 89.4%），位于 tail-256（~76-79%）和 tail-512\n      （~94-97%）之间偏上位置。这意味着 256→384 已获取约 71% 的 256→512 总增益，384→512 仅贡献剩余\n      29%。曲线呈平滑凹形（concave, diminishing returns），无任何 token 数阈值处的阶跃函数特征。根因：\n      tail 截断保留 trace 末尾的 exception/assertion 信息，384 tokens 已捕获大部分 exception 事件\n      （平均 exception 长度 ~50-150 tokens），额外 128 tokens（384→512）仅增量覆盖更长的 stack trace\n      和额外 assertion output。CodeLlama-13B 因模型容量更大（13B vs 6-7B），在同等 token budget 下\n      利用信息效率更高，故 tail-384 达 91.8%。DeepSeek 因已知的 LoRA 训练不稳定性，在 intermediate\n      token budget 下 accuracy 略低于其他模型。关键结论：256→512 的 accuracy 跳跃是 information\n      accumulation 的连续过程，而非 phase transition。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 4-Model Tail Budget Curve (Complete)\"\n        content: |\n          | Tail tokens | Qwen-7B | DeepSeek-7B | Qwen-1.5B | CodeLlama-13B | Mean |\n          |-------------|---------|-------------|-----------|---------------|------|\n          | 256         | 77.5%   | 76.4%       | 72.6%     | 77.9%         | 76.1%|\n          | 384 (NEW)   | 89.1%   | 88.2%       | 88.5%     | 91.8%         | 89.4%|\n          | 512         | 93.6%   | 93.9%       | 95.6%     | 97.5%         | 95.2%|\n          | 1024        | 96.5%   | 96.5%       | 96.6%     | 98.2%         | 97.0%|\n          | 2048        | 97.3%   | 95.0%       | 97.9%     | collapse       | —   |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4-model tail budget curve line plot: x=tail tokens (log scale), y=accuracy。所有模型显示平滑单调递增，无明显拐点。256→384 和 384→512 的斜率连续递减，无阶跃特征。CodeLlama-2048 点缺失（collapse）。\"\n    analysis: >-\n      结果排除 sharp phase transition 假说。budget curve 仅描述 trivial monotonic pattern（more\n      tokens → better），不构成 structured finding。审稿人会问 'so what?'——无法从中提取有意义的\n      design guideline（除 'use more tokens'）。建议：将 budget curve 降级为 appendix Figure，\n      正文一句话概括 'accuracy increases monotonically with tail token budget (Appendix X)'。\n      不作为独立 contribution。唯一可保留的 insight：tail >> head 的方向性（已在现有数据中确立），\n      但这也不需要 384 点来证明。plan_016 的边际贡献为零。\n\n  - name: \"cross-seed budget curve tail-512 (4 models × 3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_017\"\n    description: \"tail-512 × 4 模型 × 3 seeds，验证 phase transition 后 convergence band robustness\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b_seeds: [0.936, 0.918, 0.943]\n      qwen7b_mean: 0.932\n      qwen7b_std_pp: 1.3\n      deepseek7b_seeds: [0.939, 0.821, 0.924]\n      deepseek7b_mean: 0.895\n      deepseek7b_std_pp: 6.4\n      qwen15b_seeds: [0.956, 0.925, 0.941]\n      qwen15b_mean: 0.941\n      qwen15b_std_pp: 1.6\n      codellama13b_seeds: [0.975, 0.928, 0.961]\n      codellama13b_mean: 0.955\n      codellama13b_std_pp: 2.5\n      max_std_across_models_pp: 6.4\n      min_256to512_gain_worst_seed_pp: 5.7\n      deepseek_worst_seed_accuracy: 0.821\n    result_rationale: >-\n      DeepSeek 的 LoRA 初始化敏感性（exception_only seed123=91.09% vs seed42=99.33%）在 tail-512\n      条件下更为严重。tail-512 的学习任务比 exception_only 更难——需要从 512 tokens 的混合 trace\n      content（包含 exception + partial loop + variable values）中提取 verdict signal，对 LoRA\n      初始化 basin 的要求更高。DeepSeek seed123 的 fail_recall 预计仅 ~55-60%（类比 exception_only\n      seed123 的 0.705），导致整体 accuracy 降至 ~82%。此时 tail-512 worst seed（82.1%）与 tail-256\n      (76.4%) 的差距仅 5.7pp，可被审稿人解读为 noise 而非 phase transition。其他 3 模型 std 在\n      1.3-2.5pp 范围内，较为稳定但不足以弥补 DeepSeek 的高方差。关键问题：如果 phase transition\n      的幅度在最差 seed 上仅 5.7pp 且 CI overlap with noise，则 'sharp transition at ~400 tokens'\n      的叙事完全不成立。即使在稳定模型上（Qwen-7B seed range 91.8-94.3%），cross-seed CI 也与\n      tail-384 预测区间重叠，进一步模糊 transition 边界。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Seed Tail-512 Results\"\n        content: |\n          | Model         | Seed 42 | Seed 123 | Seed 456 | Mean   | Std (pp) |\n          |---------------|---------|----------|----------|--------|----------|\n          | Qwen-7B       | 93.6%   | 91.8%    | 94.3%    | 93.2%  | 1.3      |\n          | DeepSeek-7B   | 93.9%   | 82.1%    | 92.4%    | 89.5%  | 6.4      |\n          | Qwen-1.5B     | 95.6%   | 92.5%    | 94.1%    | 94.1%  | 1.6      |\n          | CodeLlama-13B | 97.5%   | 92.8%    | 96.1%    | 95.5%  | 2.5      |\n      - name: \"Table: Worst-Seed 256→512 Gain\"\n        content: |\n          | Model         | Tail-256 | Worst-seed Tail-512 | Gain (pp) |\n          |---------------|----------|---------------------|-----------|\n          | Qwen-7B       | 77.5%    | 91.8%               | 14.3      |\n          | DeepSeek-7B   | 76.4%    | 82.1%               | 5.7       |\n          | Qwen-1.5B     | 72.6%    | 92.5%               | 19.9      |\n          | CodeLlama-13B | 77.9%    | 92.8%               | 14.9      |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Box plot: 4 模型 × tail-512 accuracy，每个 box 3 seeds。DeepSeek 的 whisker 远大于其他模型，seed123 为明显离群点。\"\n    analysis: >-\n      DeepSeek std=6.4pp 直接破坏 phase transition claim 的 universality。即使 3/4 模型稳定，\n      审稿人只需指向 DeepSeek worst seed（82.1%）说 'phase transition 幅度不 robust，最差 seed\n      仅 5.7pp gain，与 noise 无法区分'。这使得 budget curve 作为 structural finding 的叙事彻底\n      瓦解。plan_017 的结果反而提供 negative evidence，强化了 'budget curve is trivial monotonic'\n      的 worst-tier 判断。唯一正面用途：DeepSeek seed sensitivity 数据可用来强化 D9（LoRA\n      initialization sensitivity）的 generality——不仅 exception_only，tail-512 也显示同样的\n      pattern。这支持将 seed sensitivity 提升为独立 methodological finding。\n\n  - name: \"error analysis (existing predictions)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_018\"\n    description: \"用已有 predictions.jsonl 分析 failure modes——哪类程序/错误容易被误判\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only_total_errors: 2\n      exception_only_error_ids: [901, 905]\n      exception_only_error_root_cause: \"GeneratorExit (already known)\"\n      vota_total_errors: 7\n      vota_error_types: { pass_to_fail: 3, fail_to_pass: 4 }\n      vota_problem_concentration: \"scattered, no dominant problem type\"\n      full_trace_total_errors: 217\n      full_trace_fail_recall: 0.696\n      full_trace_dominant_error_pattern: \"complex control flow with nested exceptions, but not statistically concentrated\"\n      no_trace_total_errors: 296\n      no_trace_bias: \"majority-class (pass) prediction bias\"\n      cross_condition_error_overlap: \"higher-condition errors are strict subset of lower-condition errors\"\n      novel_failure_taxonomy: false\n    result_rationale: >-\n      Exception_only 仅 2 个 irreducible errors（GeneratorExit），已在 D5 中完整分析，无新信息可提取。\n      VOTA 的 7 个错误分散在 7 个不同 problem 中（4 个 fail→pass 和 3 个 pass→fail），无统计上显著的\n      problem type 聚集——这是 99.41% accuracy 下 N=7 的必然结果：样本量太小无法建立有意义的 failure\n      taxonomy。Full_trace 的 217 个错误中，约 40% 来自 fail 样本（fail_recall=0.696），轻微集中在\n      含嵌套异常或复杂 generator/decorator 的题目上，但 chi-squared test 对 problem type 分布无显著\n      结果（p>0.1）。No_trace 的 296 个错误以 majority-class bias 为主（模型倾向预测 pass），这在\n      class-imbalanced 设置（71.5% pass）下是预期行为。Cross-condition error overlap 分析显示\n      exception_only 的 2 个错误 ⊂ VOTA 的 7 个 ⊂ full_trace 的 217 个，符合 hierarchy 预期但\n      不是新发现。整体上，error analysis 确认已知结论但不产生 novel insight。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Error Summary by Condition\"\n        content: |\n          | Condition      | Errors | Error rate | Dominant pattern              |\n          |----------------|--------|------------|-------------------------------|\n          | exception_only | 2      | 0.17%      | GeneratorExit (known)         |\n          | VOTA           | 7      | 0.59%      | scattered, no pattern         |\n          | full_trace     | 217    | 18.2%      | weak: complex control flow    |\n          | no_trace       | 296    | 24.9%      | majority-class bias           |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Confusion matrix heatmap × 4 conditions。exception_only 和 VOTA 几乎全白（极少错误），full_trace 和 no_trace 显示 fail class 的 recall 问题。无 striking pattern。\"\n    analysis: >-\n      Error analysis 不产生可作为 contribution 的 finding。exception_only 的 2 个 errors 已有\n      完整根因分析（D5），N=7 的 VOTA 错误无法支撑统计分析。建议：将 error analysis 作为 appendix\n      的完整性补充（reviewers expect it），但不要 claim 它为 contribution。正文一段话概括\n      'errors decrease monotonically with signal specificity; remaining errors at Tier 1\n      are representation-inherent (GeneratorExit)' 即可。\n\n  - name: \"cross-model calibration (4 models × exception_only)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_019\"\n    description: \"4 模型 × exception_only ECE/Brier 对比，验证 calibration quality 是否 universal\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b_ece: 0.0027\n      qwen7b_brier: 0.0013\n      qwen15b_ece: 0.0085\n      qwen15b_brier: 0.0038\n      codellama13b_ece: 0.0032\n      codellama13b_brier: 0.0015\n      deepseek7b_seed42_ece: 0.0048\n      deepseek7b_seed42_brier: 0.0052\n      deepseek7b_seed456_ece: 0.0051\n      deepseek7b_seed456_brier: 0.0055\n      deepseek7b_seed123_ece: 0.0652\n      deepseek7b_seed123_brier: 0.0781\n      deepseek7b_mean_ece: 0.025\n      cross_model_nonoutlier_ece_max: 0.0085\n      calibration_universality: \"3/4 models excellent; DeepSeek seed-dependent\"\n    result_rationale: >-\n      Calibration quality 本质上跟踪 accuracy：高 accuracy 模型（99.33-99.83%）的预测概率分布\n      集中在极端值（>0.99 或 <0.01），ECE 自然极低。Qwen-7B（ECE=0.0027, 已知）和 CodeLlama-13B\n      （预计 ECE=0.0032）均在 99.83% accuracy，其 calibration 几乎等价。Qwen-1.5B 虽然 accuracy\n      也是 99.83%，但 1.5B 模型的 logit distribution 通常更 peaked/uncertain，softmax 温度不同\n      导致 ECE 略高（~0.0085）但仍在优秀范围内。DeepSeek 的 seed 依赖性直接传导到 calibration：\n      seed42/456（99.33%）的 ECE ~0.005，尚可；但 seed123（91.09%）的 fail_recall 仅 0.705，意味着\n      大量 fail 样本被以 >0.5 的概率预测为 pass，导致 ECE 飙升至 ~0.065。跨模型 calibration 的叙事\n      在 worst 档下变为 'model-dependent'——3/4 模型优秀，但 DeepSeek 的 seed sensitivity 使得\n      '4 模型 universally excellent calibration' 的 claim 不成立。非离群 seeds 的 ECE 上界 0.0085\n      仍然很好，但审稿人会聚焦 DeepSeek seed123。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model Exception_Only Calibration\"\n        content: |\n          | Model          | Seed | Accuracy | ECE    | Brier  |\n          |----------------|------|----------|--------|--------|\n          | Qwen-7B        | 42   | 99.83%   | 0.0027 | 0.0013 |\n          | Qwen-1.5B      | 42   | 99.83%   | 0.0085 | 0.0038 |\n          | CodeLlama-13B  | 42   | 99.83%   | 0.0032 | 0.0015 |\n          | DeepSeek-7B    | 42   | 99.33%   | 0.0048 | 0.0052 |\n          | DeepSeek-7B    | 456  | 99.33%   | 0.0051 | 0.0055 |\n          | DeepSeek-7B    | 123  | 91.09%   | 0.0652 | 0.0781 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Reliability diagram × 4 models：Qwen-7B/1.5B 和 CodeLlama-13B 的曲线几乎与 perfect calibration diagonal 重合。DeepSeek seed42/456 轻微偏离。DeepSeek seed123 在 0.4-0.8 概率 bin 严重偏离（over-confident on incorrect pass predictions）。\"\n    analysis: >-\n      Cross-model calibration 作为独立 finding 的价值有限——calibration 跟踪 accuracy 是已知规律，\n      不提供独立 evidence dimension。在 worst 档下，DeepSeek seed123 的差 calibration（ECE=0.065）\n      使 'universal calibration excellence' 不可 claim。建议：在正文 Results 中用一段话报告\n      non-outlier 模型的 calibration 一致性（ECE<0.01），将 DeepSeek seed123 的 calibration\n      退化归因于 LoRA initialization（与 D9 一致），完整 reliability diagrams 放 appendix。\n      不作为独立 contribution。\n\n  - name: \"few-shot prompting baseline (GPT-4o / Claude)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_020\"\n    description: \"GPT-4o/Claude 在 exception_only 格式输入上的 0-shot + 3-shot verdict prediction\"\n    expected_results:\n      gpt4o_zeroshot_accuracy: 0.945\n      gpt4o_zeroshot_ci: [0.932, 0.957]\n      gpt4o_fewshot_accuracy: 0.965\n      gpt4o_fewshot_ci: [0.955, 0.975]\n      claude_zeroshot_accuracy: 0.953\n      claude_zeroshot_ci: [0.941, 0.964]\n      claude_fewshot_accuracy: 0.971\n      claude_fewshot_ci: [0.961, 0.980]\n      sft_exception_only_qwen7b: 0.9983\n      sft_vs_best_fewshot_gap_pp: 2.7\n      local_model_zeroshot_qwen7b: 0.8908\n      local_model_fewshot_qwen7b: 0.9084\n    result_rationale: >-\n      Exception_only 格式的输入结构极为简单——本质上是 '[ERROR] type: message' 的列表或空标记。\n      Frontier models（GPT-4o, Claude）在 binary classification from structured input 上极为\n      擅长，且具备 Python 异常类型的丰富知识。Zero-shot 下，frontier model 能直接推理 '[ERROR]\n      存在→fail; 不存在→pass'，达到 94-95%；少量 errors 来自 GeneratorExit 等边缘 case 和模型\n      对 'no exception but still fail'（assertion error 不在 exception_only 中）的处理。Few-shot\n      examples 明确 format 约定和边界 case 后，accuracy 进一步提升至 96-97%。相比之下，SFT\n      exception_only（99.83%）仍以 ~2.7pp 领先最佳 few-shot，但此差距在统计上虽 significant（McNemar\n      p<0.05），实际意义有限。Worst 档下的关键问题：审稿人会指出 'GPT-4o few-shot 已达 96.5%，7B\n      model SFT 仅多 3pp，是否值得 SFT overhead？'——虽然 inference cost 论点成立（7B vs GPT-4o\n      每 token 成本差 ~100x），但 'SFT uniquely enables this capability' 的叙事被削弱。\n      与已有本地模型 zero-shot 数据的对比更有意义：Qwen-7B zero-shot 89.08% vs GPT-4o zero-shot\n      94.5% → frontier model 以 5.4pp 领先同等 zero-shot，但 SFT 后 Qwen-7B 99.83% 反超 5.3pp。\n      这说明 SFT 的价值在于弥合 model capability gap。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: SFT vs Prompting Comparison\"\n        content: |\n          | Method                          | Accuracy | Cost/sample | Latency |\n          |---------------------------------|----------|-------------|---------|\n          | Qwen-7B SFT exception_only      | 99.83%   | ~$0.0001    | <100ms  |\n          | Claude 3-shot exception_only     | 97.1%    | ~$0.01      | ~2s     |\n          | GPT-4o 3-shot exception_only     | 96.5%    | ~$0.008     | ~1.5s   |\n          | Claude 0-shot exception_only     | 95.3%    | ~$0.005     | ~1s     |\n          | GPT-4o 0-shot exception_only     | 94.5%    | ~$0.004     | ~1s     |\n          | Qwen-1.5B 0-shot exception_only  | 93.5%    | ~$0.00005   | <50ms   |\n          | Qwen-7B 3-shot exception_only    | 90.8%    | ~$0.0001    | <100ms  |\n          | Qwen-7B 0-shot exception_only    | 89.1%    | ~$0.0001    | <100ms  |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: accuracy by method，按 accuracy 降序排列。SFT 最高但 GPT-4o/Claude few-shot 紧随其后，视觉上 gap 不大。\"\n    analysis: >-\n      SFT 优势收缩至 ~2.7pp under worst 档。审稿人反应分两派：(1) 'SFT 仍 statistically\n      significantly better, 且 inference cost 低 100x, 值得'；(2) 'gap 太小, frontier model\n      随版本更新可能抹平, SFT 的 practical value 不明确'。论文应 preemptively address：SFT 的\n      价值不仅在于 accuracy（+2.7pp），更在于 (a) 将 7B model 提升到 frontier-model-level\n      performance（cost reduction），(b) 在 deployment 场景下的 latency/throughput 优势，\n      (c) 隐私——exception traces 不需要发送到外部 API。但 'SFT 是 verdict task 的唯一可行路径'\n      的强 claim 不再成立。建议降级为 'SFT 是 cost-effective 路径'。\n\n  - name: \"OOD generalization (cross-language traces)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_021\"\n    description: \"在 Java/JavaScript/C++ 的 trace 上测试 exception_only 泛化性\"\n    expected_results:\n      java_accuracy: 0.845\n      java_ci: [0.81, 0.88]\n      javascript_accuracy: 0.813\n      javascript_ci: [0.77, 0.85]\n      cpp_accuracy: 0.762\n      cpp_ci: [0.72, 0.80]\n      cross_language_mean: 0.807\n      indomain_accuracy: 0.9983\n      ood_degradation_pp: 19.1\n      ood_dataset_size: \"~200 samples per language (estimated)\"\n    result_rationale: >-\n      Exception_only 模型在训练时仅见 Python 的异常格式（ValueError, TypeError, IndexError,\n      AttributeError 等），这些是 Python-specific exception 类名。OOD 语言使用不同的异常类型\n      （Java: NullPointerException, ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException; JS: TypeError, ReferenceError\n      但 message 格式不同; C++: segfault, runtime_error 文本差异更大）。虽然 exception_only 的\n      '[ERROR] type: ... message: ...' 格式是 language-agnostic 的，但模型学到的是 Python\n      exception type name → verdict 的映射，而非通用的 'error presence → fail' 规则。如果模型\n      真的只学了 '[ERROR] tag 有无' 的 binary feature，OOD 应该不降——但 format marker removal\n      实验（plan_015）显示移除标记后 accuracy 降至 96.5%，说明模型确实利用了 exception content\n      而非仅 tag presence。OOD 语言的 exception content 分布偏移导致 accuracy 显著下降。Java\n      因 exception 语义与 Python 最接近（同为 OOP，exception hierarchy 类似）而表现最好（84.5%）；\n      C++ 的 error output 格式差异最大（无标准 exception hierarchy，segfault 等信号格式不同），\n      降至 76.2%。Cross-language mean ~80.7%，比 in-domain 低 19pp。这一结果会被审稿人用来攻击\n      generalization claim，要求 multi-language training。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: OOD Cross-Language Results\"\n        content: |\n          | Language   | Accuracy | Δ vs in-domain | Notes                        |\n          |------------|----------|----------------|------------------------------|\n          | Python (ID)| 99.83%   | —              | in-domain reference          |\n          | Java       | 84.5%    | -15.3pp        | similar OOP exception model  |\n          | JavaScript | 81.3%    | -18.5pp        | different error conventions  |\n          | C++        | 76.2%    | -23.6pp        | no standard exception format |\n          | Mean OOD   | 80.7%    | -19.1pp        |                              |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: in-domain Python vs 3 OOD languages。Python 近乎满分，OOD 语言显著低于 Python，按 Java > JS > C++ 递降。error bars 宽（~200 samples/language）。\"\n    analysis: >-\n      19pp OOD 降级是 worst 档下的 critical weakness。审稿人会说 'exception signal 的 effectiveness\n      高度 language-specific，99.83% 是 Python-specific 的 artifact，不能 generalize'。论文的\n      mitigation 有限：(1) 定位为 Python-focused empirical study（但削弱 general claim）；(2) 论证\n      exception format 的 language-agnostic 设计原则（需要 multi-language training 来验证，超出\n      scope）；(3) 将 OOD 结果放 limitation section。建议：如果 OOD 数据质量可控，可以尝试\n      multi-language mixed training 看 accuracy 是否恢复，但这需要额外 12+ GPU hours 且可能\n      打开 scope creep。Under worst 档，plan_021 的结果是 net negative——暴露局限性但不提供\n      解决方案。建议推迟到 camera-ready 或 follow-up work。\n\n  - name: \"training dynamics (learning curve comparison)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_022\"\n    description: \"exception_only vs full_trace 的 per-50-steps eval learning curve，分析收敛速度差异\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only_steps_to_95pct: 80\n      exception_only_steps_to_99pct: 150\n      exception_only_total_steps: ~450\n      full_trace_steps_to_80pct: 120\n      full_trace_peak_accuracy: 0.830\n      full_trace_peak_step: 180\n      full_trace_final_accuracy: 0.818\n      convergence_speed_ratio_to_95pct: \"exception_only ~1.5x faster (trivial)\"\n      learning_curve_shape_exception: \"rapid ascent to plateau by 1/3 epoch, then flat\"\n      learning_curve_shape_full_trace: \"slow noisy ascent, mild overshoot at epoch1, regression at epoch2, partial recovery epoch3\"\n      phase_transition_in_learning: false\n    result_rationale: >-\n      Exception_only 的训练样本极短（平均 ~30-50 tokens relevant content），模型在 ~80 steps\n      （约 1/6 epoch）即可学到 '[ERROR] → fail, no error → pass' 的核心映射，by step 150\n      达到 99%+ accuracy。这不是 surprising finding——shorter input + cleaner signal = faster\n      convergence 是 trivial prediction。Full_trace 的 learning curve 更复杂但也不产生 insight：\n      初期缓慢上升（model 在大量 trace tokens 中搜索 relevant signal），epoch 1 峰值 ~83%（模型\n      初步学到一些 heuristics），epoch 2 回退至 ~76%（overfitting to training noise），epoch 3\n      部分恢复至 ~82%。这种 non-monotonic pattern 与现有数据（full_trace_seed42_v5 epoch level:\n      epoch1=83.03%, epoch2=76.30%, final=81.76%）完全一致，per-50-steps 数据只是在已知 epoch-level\n      数据之间做了插值，不提供新 finding。关键缺失：learning curve 中没有 'phase transition in\n      learning'——exception_only 不是先学 noise 再突然 snap to correct mapping，而是平滑快速收敛。\n      这排除了 'sudden generalization / grokking' 类叙事的可能。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Convergence Milestones\"\n        content: |\n          | Condition      | Steps to 80% | Steps to 90% | Steps to 95% | Peak | Final |\n          |----------------|-------------|-------------|-------------|------|-------|\n          | exception_only | 30          | 60          | 80          | 99.83%| 99.83%|\n          | full_trace     | 120         | —           | —           | 83.0% | 81.8% |\n          | VOTA           | 50          | 80          | 100         | 99.41%| 99.41%|\n          | no_trace       | 150         | —           | —           | 76.3% | 75.1% |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curve plot: x=training steps, y=eval accuracy。exception_only 快速跃升至 plateau（step ~80 后水平线）。full_trace 缓慢波动上升，可见 epoch boundary 处的 non-monotonic 跳跃。两条曲线 shape 差异明显但 interpretation trivial。\"\n    analysis: >-\n      Training dynamics 仅确认 trivial 预期：simpler input → faster convergence。无 grokking、\n      无 phase transition in learning、无 surprising convergence phenomenon。Per-50-steps\n      granularity 对已有 epoch-level 数据做了插值但不改变结论。审稿人不会对此印象深刻。建议：\n      将 learning curve 作为 appendix supplementary figure（completeness），正文一句话 'exception_only\n      converges within 1/6 epoch, while full_trace shows non-monotonic epoch-level dynamics\n      consistent with information overload'。不作为 contribution。plan_022 的边际贡献接近零，\n      且需要修改训练脚本增加 intermediate eval，8 GPU hours 的 ROI 极低。在 worst 档下建议\n      砍掉或推迟。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"f2cdb2a6-77cd-4a2d-b927-902f5b005216","total_cost_usd":0.9630365,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41500,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":26447,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41500,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":26447,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41500,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41500},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":36461,"outputTokens":19,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.036556,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":26447,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":41500,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.9264804999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"fa8627ef-c33b-40f6-8e63-01f611505e2e"}
